---
source: rust/uv_upx/tests/cli.rs
expression: "stdout(&run(uv_upx().args([\"helpers\",\n\"collect-top-level-dependencies-from-project\", \"--help\"])))"
---
Collect top-level dependencies from the project.

Usage: uv-upx helpers collect-top-level-dependencies-from-project [OPTIONS]

Options:
  -p, --project <PATH>
          Path to project root directory. Use current working directory if not specified.
      --only-special-cases
          Collect only complex and unhandled dependencies
      --preserve-original-package-names
          Preserve original package names in pyproject.toml
      --help
          Show this message and exit.
